endently. Travel uses navigate speed 0.8 and distance times 2 energy increased by carried mass; pickup uses its separate contract. No cutter, container, balance or protective equipment is assumed. Open costs one round and 1 energy for one controlled, low-force compression cycle. Fingers must be outside the compression zone, support must be stable and the shell must not present an uncontrolled ejection hazard. No impact, hammering, sharp-shell hand squeezing or repeated force escalation is included in this minimal version. If the mechanics cannot safely open the shell at the supported load, record no opening or partial cracking, retain the real altered sample and report the limitation. Missing pressure/contact mechanics and component separation enter the existing development handoff; share applicable material/contact infrastructure with the tool operation, recording code reuse. Do not fabricate yield to compensate for absent mechanics. Inspection/separation costs one additional round and 0.2 energy and requires the actual sample and fragments in reach. It records visible shell condition, whether opened, apparent contents, visible damage/discoloration and recoverable versus scattered material. Keep recoverable contents and shell in distinct actual ground piles or in separately acquired appropriate receptacles; no free container or food-clean surface. Ground placement is explicitly not a food-safety measure. Split the original unit into kernel/contents, shell and any actual lost fragments using represented composition; if composition is not represented, implement a labeled physical composition model and record its assumptions, not measured nutritional knowledge. Conserve mass, age, existing decay and material constituents; do not create a whole kernel in addition to the intact input. No calibrated balance exists in the supplied facts, so report visible counts, approximate recovery and model accounting separately, not invented measured weights. No inferred toxicity, nutrition, preservation, sterility or safe-consumption status. Completed opening and separation are atomic progress steps with exact input/output references. Interruptions retain the actual intact, cracked or opened state. Resume revalidates item identity, reach and equipment; it does not charge again for completed steps or restore an intact nut. Cancellation returns surviving reserved material once, leaving already separated products at their actual locations; death releases them there. Spent energy, time, tool wear and scattered losses are not refunded. Failed precondition checks do not consume the nut or charge work. Food continues normal aging during real elapsed rounds and after completion; no unattended opening, preservation or decay reset. Check pressure surfaces for new damage before reuse; replacement or cleaning requires actual materials and separate real work, with no automatic maintenance. Actual participants must communicate and act independently; no helper or transferred tool is assumed. Development waiting does not advance the world.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":2,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Study requires two individual simulation rounds at 0.5 energy per round after implementation; it grants neither mastery to another actor nor experiential rewards. Actual inspection of newly exposed contents or an informative mechanical failure can qualify as personally applicable information gain. Deduplicate by actor, sample/property, method and materially changed conditions; repeating a request or rereading the same result does not qualify. Apply the same shared functional benefit limits as the tool operation: short pleasure at most 0.02 per qualifying event-round and 0.04 per ten rounds, expiring within two rounds; slowly maintained satisfaction at most 0.01 from completed personally applicable work, total cap 0.02 and inactive decay 0.002 per round. Equivalent functions cannot bypass these limits. Familiar real practice may maintain a modest benefit without compulsory novelty. No benefit for naming, registration, queries or mastery; no eating, nutrition, physical comfort or food-safety benefit from opening alone. Preserve protected reward accounts, budgets, goals and permissions; implement all eligibility and decay rules in code. Global physical comfort remains capped at 10 and basic nutrition is independent of mood.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Use reusable material-processing metadata: sample and tool IDs, position, operation stage, shell state intact/cracked/open, actual visible contents, distinct shell/content pile IDs, scattered debris, observed defects and evidence quality. Emit compression-attempted, shell-cracked or opened only when supported, separation-completed, inspection-recorded and interrupted/blocked events. A failed compression shows an intact or genuinely partially cracked sample, never a full kernel-success animation. Do not display edible, nutritious, preserved or safe badges from appearance. Instrument-free observations remain explicitly visual and approximate.\\\"}]}\"\n}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

